# Publish authorized app builds

Package authorized development builds with `scripts/package-app.sh`, which
publishes a private GitHub prerelease, and report the tag. Production releases
use `scripts/release.sh`; neither workflow authorizes local installation or
launch. See [packaging](../../tests/Packaging/README.md) and
[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#engine-and-release-operations).
